			<div class="content" id="post-content-4479940">
									

<p>This is a idea where a mostly ordinary individual will become more powerful and dangerous (unsure how) the less people know who he is. This would be a very interesting containment challenge for the foundation, as they would have to make more people aware of something rather than less aware.</p>
<p>My first thought of containment went to a talk-show host, but it might not be perfect. The containment would essentially be the foundation trying to make him as well known as possible. This does not need to be good press either, so foundation members would be hired to start and maintain rumors about him.</p>
<p>I'm unsure of how exactly to make him such a threat that they'd expend all this effort to contain him but not so much of a threat they'd start wars with him at the helm. My best thought goes to him making the hume level of things really low, as the more people know who he is arguably the more &quot;real&quot; he becomes, and the less people know the less real and so forth.</p>
<p>It's rather undeveloped at the moment, but i thought it was an interesting concept</p>
<p>Any feedback Appreciated!</p>

